<title>USA: East Penn SD, Pa., adjusted TIC and final details.</title>
<headline>East Penn SD, Pa., adjusted TIC and final details.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The East Penn School District, Pa., said it recalculated Janney Montgomery Scott Inc's winning bid on the District's $12.5 million general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>The District said the true interest cost was 5.404 percent reflecting the cost of bond insurance, not the 5.38 percent originally calculated.</p>
</text>
